# Vendored TalkingHead repo extras not used by the running app — only modules/,
# public/avatars/brunette.glb, api/, and src/ are actually needed at runtime.
# Leading slashes matter here: unanchored patterns also matched public/avatars and
# silently dropped the one avatar file the app actually serves (404 in production).
/avatars
/examples-full-demo
/audio
/images
/blender
/fonts
/animations
/poses
/tests
/examples
/TALKINGHEAD_UPSTREAM.md
